---
description: Prepare one interpretFailure evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: EventCommitment[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Read staff reports and provider updates to determine what capability is lost and which parts of the program are affected. Separate confirmed facts from estimates and avoid assuming a missing person or resource will return by a convenient time. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
